<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sum-mĭnistro</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subm-</span></b> ), āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to aid by giving; to give</i>, <i>furnish</i>, <i>afford</i>, <i>supply</i> (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pecuniam alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Deiot. 9, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tela clam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Cael. 9, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tela ad manum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					5, 7, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tela agentibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 3, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapides telaque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 3, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frumentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auxilia hostibus nostris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sauciis ac defatigatis integros equites, Auct.
					B. Afr. 78: puteus, qui CCC. pondo argenti Hannibali
					sumministravit in dies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					33, 6, 31, § 97</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquam radicibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 5,
					10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pabulum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					3, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tabellarios,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Q. Fr. 2, 13, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cibum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 5, 14, 17</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Aristoteles huic arti plurima adjumenta atque
					ornamenta sumministravit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Inv. 1, 5, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">occasiones alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Tib. 61</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">timores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 104, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">materiam eloquentiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. Or. 37</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tantum animorum viriumque patriae et penatium
					conspectus sumministrat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					6, 7, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spem salutis licet tardam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 11 <i>init.</i></span></i>
			</div>
